NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT license above covers the playbook text, prompt structures, frameworks,
and reference tables in this repository. It does NOT extend to:

  - Sref codes, moodboard IDs, or personalization profiles authored by BHIL
  - Brand assets, color palettes, logos, or wordmarks owned by BHIL or its clients
  - Character references, Omni-Reference URLs, or persona libraries
  - Any client deliverables, redacted or otherwise

Those remain proprietary BHIL assets and are documented in the access-controlled
brand vault. The placeholders in this repository (e.g. `[BHIL PROFILE]`,
`[BHIL COVER SREFS]`, illustrative numeric codes like `1742826451`) are
documentation conventions, not real codes.
